        {
          "text": "Na kwajanwa muntu uubba mu-Israyelinyina kuti amunjizye mubuzike nanka kumuulisya, oyo mubbi uleelede kufwa. Mbuboobo mbumweelede kunyonyoona bubi akati kanu,",
